==Battleground==
*5 [[B.B.Bunny|B.B.Bunnies]] spawn after 10 seconds<sup>300f</sup>, delay 6.67~13.33 seconds<sup>200f~400f</sup>.
*Infinite [[B.B.Bunny|B.B.Bunnies]] spawn after 60 seconds<sup>1,800f</sup>, delay 20~40 seconds<sup>600f~1,200f</sup>.
*1 [[Pigge]] spawns after 13.33 seconds<sup>400f</sup>.
*1 [[Pigge]] spawns after 40 seconds<sup>1,200f</sup>.
*1 [[Pigge]] spawns after 46.67 seconds<sup>1,400f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 99% HP:
**1 [[M. Bison (Enemy)|M. Bison]] spawns as the boss.
**10 [[Gory|Gories]] spawn, delay 10~13.33 seconds<sup>300f~400f</sup>.
**5 [[Gory|Gories]] spawn, delay 16.67~20 seconds<sup>500f~600f</sup>.
**1 [[Teacher Bear]] spawns.

